  dialogue:
  - We're in trouble!
  - The Concocter is at his tricks again, and is taking our energy to form his army!
  - You are the only one strong enough to take him on and save us!
  - His tower is not easy to pass through, either.
  - You'll need to use your grapple hook to avoid obstacles and his army members.
    Just hold left click to grapple, and then hold space to reel yourself in!!
  - The tower is just down this path. Good luck!
